{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["And He mentioned here <b>in the place which YHWH will choose to cause His name to dwell there</b>, and likewise He said (Deuteronomy 16:16), \"Three times in the year all your males shall appear, etc., in the place which He will choose.\" And I do not know whether to say that after the Temple is built, they may not gather to offer the festival offerings except in that place which YHWH will choose — for the same reason that He says (Deuteronomy 16:5), \"You may not slaughter the Passover offering within any of your gates\" — or whether it is explained here that they are not obligated to go up on the festival until HaShem chooses a place for His dwelling there."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T02:50:24.520915166Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}